- A well-styled Markdown editor with editing/preview/split modes, formatting toolbar, and uploads
- Firebase Firestore for storing docs and Storage for media uploads
- A lightweight “MarkdownRX” wrapper component for rendering/preview and simple markdown editing behaviors
