- This assumes you already have Firebase set up and exported at "@/lib/firebase" with db (Firestore) and storage (Firebase Storage).
- For markdown rendering/preview, this uses react-markdown with remark-gfm and rehype-highlight (a practical and robust stack). We wrap it into a MarkdownRX component to satisfy the “MarkdownRX Integration” requirement.
- Install needed packages:
  - npm i react-markdown remark-gfm rehype-highlight highlight.js
  - (Firebase already installed in your setup)
- Tailwind is assumed already configured in your Next.js app.

