  - lib/markdownrx.ts: unified/remark/rehype pipeline → sanitized, highlighted HTML
  - components/MarkdownRX.tsx: Preview and Editor components
- Multi-page system:
  - /docs: list all docs + create new
  - /docs/[slug]: edit one doc (title + markdown content)
- Firebase integration:
  - Firestore (collection: docs) for persistent storage
  - Storage for image uploads inserted into markdown
- Tailwind styling:
  - Use Tailwind Typography (prose) for beautiful, readable docs
  - Editor and toolbar styled with Tailwind
- Client components:
  - Remember to add "use client" directive at the top of files that use client hooks (useState/useEffect)

Before you start
