- OpenSSL is used for SHA3-256 and for base64 decoding (EVP). Link libcrypto accordingly (e.g., libcrypto-3-x64.lib on OpenSSL 3.x or libcrypto.lib on 1.1.1).

Example builds (MSVC):
- cl /std:c++17 /O2 /EHsc tor_onion_tool.cpp winhttp.lib
- Add your OpenSSL import library (e.g., libcrypto) as needed.

